  "details": "Thank you for all your development work.\n\nNow, the capacity of the RenderTexture is currently not reflected in the capacity of the TextureMemory.\n\nThis also makes it easy to create a high load situation by placing multiple Camera components on the avatar.\n\nHowever, RenderTexture is variable and I think that the capacity limit is strict.\n\nSo, would it be possible to add hiding the Camera component to Safety?\n\nPlease consider this.",
